# advanced: causative (~せる/~させる), passive (~れる/~られる), ~たら/~ば
# conditionals, ~のに, ~ようになる, ~てしまう, ~ておく, ~はず, ~ことにする/
# ~ことになる, ~という, and keigo where the scene calls for it (business
# introductions, addressing a mentor/senior).

